ng the series (gate 0)", "note7": "VF: a pager page, a cursor row moved by Down, an htop-style repaint, an edit on a full screen, a 60x200 screen in ASCII and Cyrillic (caret mid-screen, Left)", "note8": "VB: a second terminal floods at 60 frames/s while the focused one is typed in; the key echo and the shell echo of the focused one are the only speech", "note9": "VW: output after Alt+Tab into the terminal before any key; lost per case [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] (order, FOCUSED lag, bounce: [(\"activate_first\", 0, false), (\"focus_first\", 0, false), (\"focus_first\", 8, false), (\"activate_first\", 8, false), (\"focus_first\", 8, true), (\"focus_first\", 160, false), (\"focus_first\", 400, false)]); latency is frame emit to SPEAK as in V1", "note10": "VT: 9661 keys (typed 8562, BackSpace 331, Left 347, Right 347, Enter 74); every one spoken exactly once, nothing else", "note11": "probe #11 (type; before: type \"V\", type \"y\") wanted \"3\", heard [-53.2ms \"V\", -27.1ms \"y\", +0.3ms \"3\", +55.3ms \"Sorry, try again.\\n[sudo] password for me:\"]", "note12": "probe #11 (type; before: type \"V\", type \"y\") wanted \"3\", heard [-53.9ms \"V\", -27.8ms \"y\", +0.4ms \"3\", +57.8ms \"Sorry, try again.\\n[sudo] password for me:\"]", "note13": "VT: 9632 keys (typed 8467, BackSpace 345, Left 373, Right 373, Enter 74); every one spoken exactly once, nothing else"},
